OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEx-media executive admits saying       
OL,4,AAustralian child sex abuse survivor    
OL,5,A'looking to be raped again'            
OL,7,FIn an op-ed for independent media      
OL,8,Foutlet Crikey, Tame said she overheard 
OL,9,FMatt Handbury speaking to a friend, and
OL,10,Fwas left distressed by the remark and  
OL,11,Fthe failure of others who heard it to  
OL,12,Fintervene.                             
OL,14,FHandbury, nephew of Rupert Murdoch and 
OL,15,Fa former executive at his firms, has   
OL,16,Fnot responded to a BBC request for     
OL,17,Fcomment, but in an email to Tame said  
OL,18,Fhe regretted the "highly objectionable"
OL,19,Fcomment as soon as he said it.         
